


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_cf776797:



    voice "2FU_0636"
    fumi "「我回来了——呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_971835f1:


    "购物回来的文一进门就发出了悲鸣。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_19b995e3:



    voice "2SA_0589"
    namahage_sachiko "「有没有坏孩子啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_908a92cc:



    voice "2RI_0785"
    rin "「生剥鬼……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_3a94875a:



    voice "2SA_0590"
    namahage_sachiko "「有没有身材任性的坏女孩啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_886cb501:


    "铛！"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_90c4649a:



    voice "2SA_0591"
    namahage_sachiko "「呀啊！好、好硬！这是撞上什么东西了！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_7ed0c1cd:



    voice "2HI_0776"
    hina "「干烧沙丁鱼的罐头」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_4fc31e0f:



    voice "2SA_0592"
    namahage_sachiko "「喂，别用罐头啊！至少换成豆子啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_6c544d0f:



    voice "2HI_0777"
    hina "「因为是促销品所以还有很多哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_b49211b1:


    "阳菜又举起了一个罐头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_16077548:



    voice "2SA_0593"
    sachiko "「唔哇——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_426821a4:



    voice "2RI_0786"
    rin "「生剥鬼变成爱哭鬼怎么行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_39e45a77:



    voice "2HI_0778"
    hina "「各种地方都搞错了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_00972c0b:



    voice "2MI_0705"
    miyako "「做工很精细啊。在哪里找到的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_e4bb4184:


    "圣夜子确认着生剥鬼服装，惊讶于它的完成度之高。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_40c052c5:



    voice "2SA_0594"
    sachiko "「……秋田」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_c4f39080:



    voice "2RI_0787"
    rin "「那不是原产地吗！该努力的地方搞错了吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_1cf78db9:



    voice "2SA_0595"
    sachiko "「想着让你们大吃一惊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_f938754a:



    voice "2FU_0637"
    fumi "「大吃一惊了啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_514d2849:



    voice "2SA_0596"
    sachiko "「太好啦——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_fdaa7613:


    "祥子做出了小小的必胜姿势。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_e971b58e:



    voice "2HI_0779"
    hina "「说到底为什么生剥鬼会在家里等着啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_bcad3b2e:


    "生剥鬼一般来说是闯进住宅里的东西，而不是在住宅里迎接别人的东西。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_b2d15d7f:



    voice "2SA_0597"
    sachiko "「因为是节分」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_d11b354a:



    voice "2FU_0638"
    fumi "「咦，原来这个是鬼吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_2c7623d2:



    voice "2HI_0780"
    hina "「那不是反了吗！鬼怎么在里面啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_15d7e5a8:


    "生剥鬼本来是“来访神”，把它算作“鬼”可能也不太对就是了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_b2449a21:



    voice "2MI_0706"
    miyako "「啊、是这个吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_8deb5ec2:


    "圣夜子从购物袋里取出了一个鬼的硬纸面具。那是超市的赠品。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_695b55dd:



    voice "2RI_0788"
    rin "「直接用这种面具不就行了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_ce726bfc:



    voice "2SA_0598"
    sachiko "「来过节分吧！有没有撒豆子的孩子啊——！有没有吃惠方卷的孩子啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_518f54f2:



    voice "2HI_0781"
    hina "「这家伙在发什么神经……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_607ea7a3:



    voice "2MI_0707"
    miyako "「啊——过节分啦——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_08_d93b4c16:



    voice "2RI_0789"
    rin "「这边也……」"
